{"page":517,"verses":[{"verse_key":"49:12","surah":49,"ayah":12,"ar_uthmani":"يَـٰٓأَيُّهَا ٱلَّذِينَ ءَامَنُوا۟ ٱجْتَنِبُوا۟ كَثِيرًا مِّنَ ٱلظَّنِّ إِنَّ بَعْضَ ٱلظَّنِّ إِثْمٌ ۖ وَلَا تَجَسَّسُوا۟ وَلَا يَغْتَب بَّعْضُكُم بَعْضًا ۚ أَيُحِبُّ أَحَدُكُمْ أَن يَأْكُلَ لَحْمَ أَخِيهِ مَيْتًا فَكَرِهْتُمُوهُ ۚ وَٱتَّقُوا۟ ٱللَّهَ ۚ إِنَّ ٱللَّهَ تَوَّابٌ رَّحِيمٌ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"Believers, avoid making too many assumptions- some assumptions are sinful- and do not spy on one another or speak ill of people behind their backs: would any of you like to eat the flesh of your dead brother? No, you would hate it. So be mindful of God: God is ever relenting, most merciful.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"يَـٰٓأَيُّهَا","en_gloss":"O you who believe","transliteration":"yāayyuhā","verse_key":"49:12"},{"pos":2,"ar":"ٱلَّذِينَ","en_gloss":"O you who believe","transliteration":"alladhīna","verse_key":"49:12"},{"pos":3,"ar":"ءَامَنُوا۟","en_gloss":"O you who believe","transliteration":"āmanū","verse_key":"49:12"},{"pos":4,"ar":"ٱجْتَنِبُوا۟","en_gloss":"Avoid","transliteration":"ij'tanibū","verse_key":"49:12"},{"pos":5,"ar":"كَثِيرًۭا","en_gloss":"much","transliteration":"kathīran","verse_key":"49:12"},{"pos":6,"ar":"مِّنَ","en_gloss":"of","transliteration":"mina","verse_key":"49:12"},{"pos":7,"ar":"ٱلظَّنِّ","en_gloss":"the assumption","transliteration":"l-ẓani","verse_key":"49:12"},{"pos":8,"ar":"إِنَّ","en_gloss":"Indeed","transliteration":"inna","verse_key":"49:12"},{"pos":9,"ar":"بَعْضَ","en_gloss":"some","transliteration":"baʿḍa","verse_key":"49:12"},{"pos":10,"ar":"ٱلظَّنِّ","en_gloss":"assumption","transliteration":"l-ẓani","verse_key":"49:12"},{"pos":11,"ar":"إِثْمٌۭ ۖ","en_gloss":"(is) sin","transliteration":"ith'mun","verse_key":"49:12"},{"pos":12,"ar":"وَلَا","en_gloss":"And (do) not","transliteration":"walā","verse_key":"49:12"},{"pos":13,"ar":"تَجَسَّسُوا۟","en_gloss":"spy","transliteration":"tajassasū","verse_key":"49:12"},{"pos":14,"ar":"وَلَا","en_gloss":"and (do) not","transliteration":"walā","verse_key":"49:12"},{"pos":15,"ar":"يَغْتَب","en_gloss":"backbite","transliteration":"yaghtab","verse_key":"49:12"},{"pos":16,"ar":"بَّعْضُكُم","en_gloss":"some of you","transliteration":"baʿḍukum","verse_key":"49:12"},{"pos":17,"ar":"بَعْضًا ۚ","en_gloss":"(to) others","transliteration":"baʿḍan","verse_key":"49:12"},{"pos":18,"ar":"أَيُحِبُّ","en_gloss":"Would like","transliteration":"ayuḥibbu","verse_key":"49:12"},{"pos":19,"ar":"أَحَدُكُمْ","en_gloss":"one of you","transliteration":"aḥadukum","verse_key":"49:12"},{"pos":20,"ar":"أَن","en_gloss":"to","transliteration":"an","verse_key":"49:12"},{"pos":21,"ar":"يَأْكُلَ","en_gloss":"eat","transliteration":"yakula","verse_key":"49:12"},{"pos":22,"ar":"لَحْمَ","en_gloss":"(the) flesh","transliteration":"laḥma","verse_key":"49:12"},{"pos":23,"ar":"أَخِيهِ","en_gloss":"(of) his brother","transliteration":"akhīhi","verse_key":"49:12"},{"pos":24,"ar":"مَيْتًۭا","en_gloss":"dead","transliteration":"maytan","verse_key":"49:12"},{"pos":25,"ar":"فَكَرِهْتُمُوهُ ۚ","en_gloss":"Nay, you would hate it","transliteration":"fakarih'tumūhu","verse_key":"49:12"},{"pos":26,"ar":"وَٱتَّقُوا۟","en_gloss":"And fear Allah","transliteration":"wa-ittaqū","verse_key":"49:12"},{"pos":27,"ar":"ٱللَّهَ ۚ","en_gloss":"And fear Allah","transliteration":"l-laha","verse_key":"49:12"},{"pos":28,"ar":"إِنَّ","en_gloss":"indeed","transliteration":"inna","verse_key":"49:12"},{"pos":29,"ar":"ٱللَّهَ","en_gloss":"Allah","transliteration":"l-laha","verse_key":"49:12"},{"pos":30,"ar":"تَوَّابٌۭ","en_gloss":"(is) Oft-Returning","transliteration":"tawwābun","verse_key":"49:12"},{"pos":31,"ar":"رَّحِيمٌۭ","en_gloss":"Most Merciful","transliteration":"raḥīmun","verse_key":"49:12"},{"pos":32,"ar":"١٢","en_gloss":"(12)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"49:12"}]},{"verse_key":"49:13","surah":49,"ayah":13,"ar_uthmani":"يَـٰٓأَيُّهَا ٱلنَّاسُ إِنَّا خَلَقْنَـٰكُم مِّن ذَكَرٍ وَأُنثَىٰ وَجَعَلْنَـٰكُمْ شُعُوبًا وَقَبَآئِلَ لِتَعَارَفُوٓا۟ ۚ إِنَّ أَكْرَمَكُمْ عِندَ ٱللَّهِ أَتْقَىٰكُمْ ۚ إِنَّ ٱللَّهَ عَلِيمٌ خَبِيرٌ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"People, We created you all from a single man and a single woman, and made you into races and tribes so that you should recognize one another. In God’s eyes, the most honoured of you are the ones most mindful of Him: God is all knowing, all aware.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"يَـٰٓأَيُّهَا","en_gloss":"O mankind","transliteration":"yāayyuhā","verse_key":"49:13"},{"pos":2,"ar":"ٱلنَّاسُ","en_gloss":"O mankind","transliteration":"l-nāsu","verse_key":"49:13"},{"pos":3,"ar":"إِنَّا","en_gloss":"Indeed, We","transliteration":"innā","verse_key":"49:13"},{"pos":4,"ar":"خَلَقْنَـٰكُم","en_gloss":"created you","transliteration":"khalaqnākum","verse_key":"49:13"},{"pos":5,"ar":"مِّن","en_gloss":"from","transliteration":"min","verse_key":"49:13"},{"pos":6,"ar":"ذَكَرٍۢ","en_gloss":"a male","transliteration":"dhakarin","verse_key":"49:13"},{"pos":7,"ar":"وَأُنثَىٰ","en_gloss":"and a female","transliteration":"wa-unthā","verse_key":"49:13"},{"pos":8,"ar":"وَجَعَلْنَـٰكُمْ","en_gloss":"and We made you","transliteration":"wajaʿalnākum","verse_key":"49:13"},{"pos":9,"ar":"شُعُوبًۭا","en_gloss":"nations","transliteration":"shuʿūban","verse_key":"49:13"},{"pos":10,"ar":"وَقَبَآئِلَ","en_gloss":"and tribes","transliteration":"waqabāila","verse_key":"49:13"},{"pos":11,"ar":"لِتَعَارَفُوٓا۟ ۚ","en_gloss":"that you may know one another","transliteration":"litaʿārafū","verse_key":"49:13"},{"pos":12,"ar":"إِنَّ","en_gloss":"Indeed","transliteration":"inna","verse_key":"49:13"},{"pos":13,"ar":"أَكْرَمَكُمْ","en_gloss":"(the) most noble of you","transliteration":"akramakum","verse_key":"49:13"},{"pos":14,"ar":"عِندَ","en_gloss":"near","transliteration":"ʿinda","verse_key":"49:13"},{"pos":15,"ar":"ٱللَّهِ","en_gloss":"Allah","transliteration":"l-lahi","verse_key":"49:13"},{"pos":16,"ar":"أَتْقَىٰكُمْ ۚ","en_gloss":"(is the) most righteous of you","transliteration":"atqākum","verse_key":"49:13"},{"pos":17,"ar":"إِنَّ","en_gloss":"Indeed","transliteration":"inna","verse_key":"49:13"},{"pos":18,"ar":"ٱللَّهَ","en_gloss":"Allah","transliteration":"l-laha","verse_key":"49:13"},{"pos":19,"ar":"عَلِيمٌ","en_gloss":"(is) All-Knower","transliteration":"ʿalīmun","verse_key":"49:13"},{"pos":20,"ar":"خَبِيرٌۭ","en_gloss":"All-Aware","transliteration":"khabīrun","verse_key":"49:13"},{"pos":21,"ar":"١٣","en_gloss":"(13)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"49:13"}]},{"verse_key":"49:14","surah":49,"ayah":14,"ar_uthmani":"۞ قَالَتِ ٱلْأَعْرَابُ ءَامَنَّا ۖ قُل لَّمْ تُؤْمِنُوا۟ وَلَـٰكِن قُولُوٓا۟ أَسْلَمْنَا وَلَمَّا يَدْخُلِ ٱلْإِيمَـٰنُ فِى قُلُوبِكُمْ ۖ وَإِن تُطِيعُوا۟ ٱللَّهَ وَرَسُولَهُۥ لَا يَلِتْكُم مِّنْ أَعْمَـٰلِكُمْ شَيْـًٔا ۚ إِنَّ ٱللَّهَ غَفُورٌ رَّحِيمٌ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"The desert Arabs say, ‘We have faith.’ [Prophet], tell them, ‘You do not have faith. What you should say instead is, “We have submitted,” for faith has not yet entered your hearts.’ If you obey God and His Messenger, He will not diminish any of your deeds: He is most forgiving and most merciful.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"۞ قَالَتِ","en_gloss":"Say","transliteration":"qālati","verse_key":"49:14"},{"pos":2,"ar":"ٱلْأَعْرَابُ","en_gloss":"the Bedouins","transliteration":"l-aʿrābu","verse_key":"49:14"},{"pos":3,"ar":"ءَامَنَّا ۖ","en_gloss":"We believe","transliteration":"āmannā","verse_key":"49:14"},{"pos":4,"ar":"قُل","en_gloss":"Say","transliteration":"qul","verse_key":"49:14"},{"pos":5,"ar":"لَّمْ","en_gloss":"Not","transliteration":"lam","verse_key":"49:14"},{"pos":6,"ar":"تُؤْمِنُوا۟","en_gloss":"you believe","transliteration":"tu'minū","verse_key":"49:14"},{"pos":7,"ar":"وَلَـٰكِن","en_gloss":"but","transliteration":"walākin","verse_key":"49:14"},{"pos":8,"ar":"قُولُوٓا۟","en_gloss":"say","transliteration":"qūlū","verse_key":"49:14"},{"pos":9,"ar":"أَسْلَمْنَا","en_gloss":"We have submitted","transliteration":"aslamnā","verse_key":"49:14"},{"pos":10,"ar":"وَلَمَّا","en_gloss":"and has not yet","transliteration":"walammā","verse_key":"49:14"},{"pos":11,"ar":"يَدْخُلِ","en_gloss":"entered","transliteration":"yadkhuli","verse_key":"49:14"},{"pos":12,"ar":"ٱلْإِيمَـٰنُ","en_gloss":"the faith","transliteration":"l-īmānu","verse_key":"49:14"},{"pos":13,"ar":"فِى","en_gloss":"in","transliteration":"fī","verse_key":"49:14"},{"pos":14,"ar":"قُلُوبِكُمْ ۖ","en_gloss":"your hearts","transliteration":"qulūbikum","verse_key":"49:14"},{"pos":15,"ar":"وَإِن","en_gloss":"But if","transliteration":"wa-in","verse_key":"49:14"},{"pos":16,"ar":"تُطِيعُوا۟","en_gloss":"you obey","transliteration":"tuṭīʿū","verse_key":"49:14"},{"pos":17,"ar":"ٱللَّهَ","en_gloss":"Allah","transliteration":"l-laha","verse_key":"49:14"},{"pos":18,"ar":"وَرَسُولَهُۥ","en_gloss":"and His Messenger","transliteration":"warasūlahu","verse_key":"49:14"},{"pos":19,"ar":"لَا","en_gloss":"not","transliteration":"lā","verse_key":"49:14"},{"pos":20,"ar":"يَلِتْكُم","en_gloss":"He will deprive you","transliteration":"yalit'kum","verse_key":"49:14"},{"pos":21,"ar":"مِّنْ","en_gloss":"of","transliteration":"min","verse_key":"49:14"},{"pos":22,"ar":"أَعْمَـٰلِكُمْ","en_gloss":"your deeds","transliteration":"aʿmālikum","verse_key":"49:14"},{"pos":23,"ar":"شَيْـًٔا ۚ","en_gloss":"anything","transliteration":"shayan","verse_key":"49:14"},{"pos":24,"ar":"إِنَّ","en_gloss":"Indeed","transliteration":"inna","verse_key":"49:14"},{"pos":25,"ar":"ٱللَّهَ","en_gloss":"Allah","transliteration":"l-laha","verse_key":"49:14"},{"pos":26,"ar":"غَفُورٌۭ","en_gloss":"(is) Oft-Forgiving","transliteration":"ghafūrun","verse_key":"49:14"},{"pos":27,"ar":"رَّحِيمٌ","en_gloss":"Most Merciful","transliteration":"raḥīmun","verse_key":"49:14"},{"pos":28,"ar":"١٤","en_gloss":"(14)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"49:14"}]},{"verse_key":"49:15","surah":49,"ayah":15,"ar_uthmani":"إِنَّمَا ٱلْمُؤْمِنُونَ ٱلَّذِينَ ءَامَنُوا۟ بِٱللَّهِ وَرَسُولِهِۦ ثُمَّ لَمْ يَرْتَابُوا۟ وَجَـٰهَدُوا۟ بِأَمْوَٰلِهِمْ وَأَنفُسِهِمْ فِى سَبِيلِ ٱللَّهِ ۚ أُو۟لَـٰٓئِكَ هُمُ ٱلصَّـٰدِقُونَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"The true believers are the ones who have faith in God and His Messenger and leave all doubt behind, the ones who have struggled with their possessions and their persons in God’s way: they are the ones who are true.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"إِنَّمَا","en_gloss":"Only","transliteration":"innamā","verse_key":"49:15"},{"pos":2,"ar":"ٱلْمُؤْمِنُونَ","en_gloss":"the believers","transliteration":"l-mu'minūna","verse_key":"49:15"},{"pos":3,"ar":"ٱلَّذِينَ","en_gloss":"(are) those who","transliteration":"alladhīna","verse_key":"49:15"},{"pos":4,"ar":"ءَامَنُوا۟","en_gloss":"believe","transliteration":"āmanū","verse_key":"49:15"},{"pos":5,"ar":"بِٱللَّهِ","en_gloss":"in Allah","transliteration":"bil-lahi","verse_key":"49:15"},{"pos":6,"ar":"وَرَسُولِهِۦ","en_gloss":"and His Messenger","transliteration":"warasūlihi","verse_key":"49:15"},{"pos":7,"ar":"ثُمَّ","en_gloss":"then","transliteration":"thumma","verse_key":"49:15"},{"pos":8,"ar":"لَمْ","en_gloss":"(do) not","transliteration":"lam","verse_key":"49:15"},{"pos":9,"ar":"يَرْتَابُوا۟","en_gloss":"doubt","transliteration":"yartābū","verse_key":"49:15"},{"pos":10,"ar":"وَجَـٰهَدُوا۟","en_gloss":"but strive","transliteration":"wajāhadū","verse_key":"49:15"},{"pos":11,"ar":"بِأَمْوَٰلِهِمْ","en_gloss":"with their wealth","transliteration":"bi-amwālihim","verse_key":"49:15"},{"pos":12,"ar":"وَأَنفُسِهِمْ","en_gloss":"and their lives","transliteration":"wa-anfusihim","verse_key":"49:15"},{"pos":13,"ar":"فِى","en_gloss":"in","transliteration":"fī","verse_key":"49:15"},{"pos":14,"ar":"سَبِيلِ","en_gloss":"(the) way","transliteration":"sabīli","verse_key":"49:15"},{"pos":15,"ar":"ٱللَّهِ ۚ","en_gloss":"(of) Allah","transliteration":"l-lahi","verse_key":"49:15"},{"pos":16,"ar":"أُو۟لَـٰٓئِكَ","en_gloss":"Those","transliteration":"ulāika","verse_key":"49:15"},{"pos":17,"ar":"هُمُ","en_gloss":"[they]","transliteration":"humu","verse_key":"49:15"},{"pos":18,"ar":"ٱلصَّـٰدِقُونَ","en_gloss":"(are) the truthful","transliteration":"l-ṣādiqūna","verse_key":"49:15"},{"pos":19,"ar":"١٥","en_gloss":"(15)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"49:15"}]},{"verse_key":"49:16","surah":49,"ayah":16,"ar_uthmani":"قُلْ أَتُعَلِّمُونَ ٱللَّهَ بِدِينِكُمْ وَٱللَّهُ يَعْلَمُ مَا فِى ٱلسَّمَـٰوَٰتِ وَمَا فِى ٱلْأَرْضِ ۚ وَٱللَّهُ بِكُلِّ شَىْءٍ عَلِيمٌ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"Say, ‘Do you presume to teach God about your religion, when God knows everything in the heavens and earth, and He has full knowledge of all things?’","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"قُلْ","en_gloss":"Say","transliteration":"qul","verse_key":"49:16"},{"pos":2,"ar":"أَتُعَلِّمُونَ","en_gloss":"Will you acquaint","transliteration":"atuʿallimūna","verse_key":"49:16"},{"pos":3,"ar":"ٱللَّهَ","en_gloss":"Allah","transliteration":"l-laha","verse_key":"49:16"},{"pos":4,"ar":"بِدِينِكُمْ","en_gloss":"with your religion","transliteration":"bidīnikum","verse_key":"49:16"},{"pos":5,"ar":"وَٱللَّهُ","en_gloss":"while Allah","transliteration":"wal-lahu","verse_key":"49:16"},{"pos":6,"ar":"يَعْلَمُ","en_gloss":"knows","transliteration":"yaʿlamu","verse_key":"49:16"},{"pos":7,"ar":"مَا","en_gloss":"what","transliteration":"mā","verse_key":"49:16"},{"pos":8,"ar":"فِى","en_gloss":"(is) in","transliteration":"fī","verse_key":"49:16"},{"pos":9,"ar":"ٱلسَّمَـٰوَٰتِ","en_gloss":"the heavens","transliteration":"l-samāwāti","verse_key":"49:16"},{"pos":10,"ar":"وَمَا","en_gloss":"and what","transliteration":"wamā","verse_key":"49:16"},{"pos":11,"ar":"فِى","en_gloss":"(is) in","transliteration":"fī","verse_key":"49:16"},{"pos":12,"ar":"ٱلْأَرْضِ ۚ","en_gloss":"the earth","transliteration":"l-arḍi","verse_key":"49:16"},{"pos":13,"ar":"وَٱللَّهُ","en_gloss":"And Allah","transliteration":"wal-lahu","verse_key":"49:16"},{"pos":14,"ar":"بِكُلِّ","en_gloss":"of every","transliteration":"bikulli","verse_key":"49:16"},{"pos":15,"ar":"شَىْءٍ","en_gloss":"thing","transliteration":"shay